==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*15 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*2 [[Duche]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Pterowl Hazuku]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Duche]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**1 [[Mooth]] spawns.
**3 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
**1 [[Le'noir]] spawns.

==Strategy==
The name of the game here is using units that are able to tank a Hazuku hit, like [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], and [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]]. Units like [[Talents|Talented]] [[Cats in a Box (Special Cat)|Heavy Assault C.A.T.]] are good to clean up Le'noir, while units like [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] and Courier Cat demolish Shy Boy. [[Ancient Egg: N111 (Super Rare Cat)|Cop Cat]], if one happens to own it, works very well for the Traitless enemies here.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]]: To get the most damage out of him, needs to be timed well, as just one hit from Hazuku will kill him. Use the Thunderbolt cannon to make this easier. In addition, try to time him when there are no peons in Hazuku's blindspot.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Count Yukimura (Uber Rare Cat)|Vampiric Yukimura]]: Much like Bahamut, you'll need to time him carefully to get the most damage out of him as possible. Luckily, at level 39+ he can actually survive a hit from Hazuku (from full HP), even without making use of his Survive Lethal Strike.

==Trivia==
*Two Miles Below's Japanese name, Kaitei 2 Mairu (海底2マイル, "2 Miles Deep"), is a reference to ''Kaitei 2-man Mairu'' (海底2万マイル, "20,000 Miles Deep"), one of the Japanese names of ''[[wikipedia:Twenty Thousand Leagues Under the Seas|Twenty Thousand Leagues Under the Seas]]'' and  ''[[wikipedia:20,000 Leagues Under the Sea (1954 film)|20,000 Leagues Under the Sea]]''.

